sequenceDiagram
  participant Lab as Lab member
  participant API
  participant NS as NotificationService
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Relay as Notification relay - worker
  participant Inbox as In-app provider
  participant Doctor as Doctor web app
  Lab->>API: Accept lab order
  API->>NS: enqueue in the same transaction
  NS->>PG: read settings, rules, templates
  NS->>PG: insert notification_outbox rows
  NS->>PG: pg_notify notification_outbox
  API->>PG: COMMIT
  PG-->>Relay: NOTIFY wakes relay, or 2 s poll
  Relay->>PG: claim due rows FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
  Relay->>Inbox: send row
  Inbox->>PG: insert user_notifications once per outbox row
  Relay->>PG: mark row sent
  Doctor->>API: GET /me/notifications/unread-count every 30 s
  API-->>Doctor: count shown on the bell
